{
  "uid": "inora-http-vs-grpc",
  "title": "Inora - HTTP vs gRPC (Assignment 2)",
  "tags": [
    "inora",
    "assignment-2"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Same operation, two front doors.** Left = HTTP `POST /orders` (Flask, metric `app_*`). Right = gRPC `PlaceOrder` (`grpc_server_*`). Both run the same business module on the same database.\n\n* **Rates** use a 1-minute window; **error rate, p50 and p95** use a **5-minute** window.\n* **Error rate** = calls that did not succeed (HTTP non-2xx, gRPC non-`OK`) divided by all calls - includes bad input, declined payments and rate limiting.\n* **Duration is measured on the server** (inside the handler), not at the client. A client deadline shows up server-side as `CANCELLED`.\n* Fill the panels with `python generate_traffic.py`."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "HTTP POST /orders - requests/s by status",
      "description": "Source: app_requests_total{method,endpoint,http_status}. Route template label, never the raw URL.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (http_status) (rate(app_requests_total{method=\"POST\", endpoint=\"/orders\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "HTTP {{http_status}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "gRPC PlaceOrder - calls/s by method and status",
      "description": "Source: grpc_server_handled_total{grpc_service,grpc_method,grpc_code}.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (grpc_method, grpc_code) (rate(grpc_server_handled_total{grpc_method!=\"unknown\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{grpc_method}} {{grpc_code}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "HTTP POST /orders - error rate (non-2xx, 5m window)",
      "description": "Non-2xx divided by all requests over the last 5 minutes.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
